headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

docs {
  OJ Auto Detailing quote API.

  Switch environments to hit local dev (localhost:3001) or production (api.oj-auto-detailing.com.au).

  Valid services: interior-package, complete-detail, transformation-detail, monthly-maintenance
  Valid addons: scratch-removal, trim-restoration, water-repellent, anti-fog, headlight-restoration, water-spot-remover
  Required fields: name, phone, email, suburb, service, terms_accepted
}
